# Portfolio visual guardrails

When editing portfolio UI, follow `.cursor/skills/portfolio-visual/SKILL.md` and `specs/04-visual-system.md`.

## Typography (one job per font)

- **Bootzy** — editorial titles, hero statements only
- **Awesome Shorten** — conversational / personality copy
- **Analogue OS** — system metadata, status, tool names
- **Inter** — body, nav, buttons, long descriptions

Classes: `.font-bootzy`, `.font-awesome-shorten`, `.font-analogue` in `app/portfolio-fonts.css`.

## Do not

- Use neon purple or saturated cyber-AI aesthetics
- Apply Architecture warm palette to Work bento without explicit request
- Put custom fonts on every element — Inter is the default utility face
- Use obvious linear gradients or glassmorphism on every card

## Page tokens

- **Architecture** → `--arch-*` in `app/architecture/architecture.css`
- **Work / Projects bento** → `--sch-*` via `PORTFOLIO_PAGE_SCHEME`
- **Ask panel** → warm cream + charcoal FAB in `app/portfolio-theme.css` (`.agent-*`)

## Card type

Pick one: editorial (warm/cream), system (charcoal/Analogue OS), hybrid (story + metadata block), or existing bento tile.
